{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Humblets",
    "steam_appid": 3694600,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Please note:</strong> Humblets is currently in early development. Please be aware that parts of the game, like the visuals, are still evolving and may change over time. We will continue to update this page with the latest information as development progresses. Thank you for your support and understanding!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a humblet, a little adventurer who crafts, decorates, and explores a charming procedural world with the help of magical cards. Pack your tent and embark on a journey alongside friends, where each step could become a tale told by the fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're crafting new items, collecting rare cards, decorating your tent, or simply relaxing by the fire, Humblets offers a warm, wholesome adventure full of discovery and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f <strong>Endless Worlds to Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two adventures are ever the same!</strong> Every game world is uniquely generated, full of secrets to find, cards to collect and friends to meet. Journey through rolling hills, enchanted forests and other whimsical landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/58c975b1a5fee85b84641271ced4d5cb.poster.avif?t=1754988347\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/58c975b1a5fee85b84641271ced4d5cb.webm?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/58c975b1a5fee85b84641271ced4d5cb.mp4?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26fa <strong>Portable Tent Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring your tent wherever you go</strong> and place it under the stars. Make it your own by decorating it with furniture, while you grow potted plants, and craft other cozy touches from blueprints you discover along the way. Connect tents with friends to form a dream shared living space for the ultimate sleepovers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/c6e81f999324c2fce5573179fbc6388d.poster.avif?t=1754988347\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/c6e81f999324c2fce5573179fbc6388d.webm?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/c6e81f999324c2fce5573179fbc6388d.mp4?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Charming Cardplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, <strong>battles are settled through a game of cards!</strong> Use your deck to overcome goofy creatures, join forces with friends against stronger foes or even challenge each other for fun. Find cards on your adventures, upgrade them at your crafting table, and trade to build your dream collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/e3cad3aa76eceaf1e3f43f2668bb30a0.poster.avif?t=1754988347\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/e3cad3aa76eceaf1e3f43f2668bb30a0.webm?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/e3cad3aa76eceaf1e3f43f2668bb30a0.mp4?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Deep Customisation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a little adventurer that\u2019s truly yours</strong>. Customize every detail from horns and tails to cozy outfits and backpack trinkets. Whether you're dressing for style, whimsy, or pure self-expression, every humblet is a reflection of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/68cce39dcb31b849a1f0286f8082253a.poster.avif?t=1754988347\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/68cce39dcb31b849a1f0286f8082253a.webm?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/68cce39dcb31b849a1f0286f8082253a.mp4?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e<strong> Cute Pet Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ll never adventure alone.</strong> Assigned by a personality quiz or chosen by you, your loyal pet will collect resources, deliver items and stay by your side wherever you wander. Every humblet needs a best friend! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/cbc8421141090862a0c522b268d2fa34.poster.avif?t=1754988347\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/cbc8421141090862a0c522b268d2fa34.webm?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/cbc8421141090862a0c522b268d2fa34.mp4?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Wholesome Vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There\u2019s no wrong way to explore</strong>, just pure cozy adventuring at your own pace. Overcome obstacles, not with combat but instead with magical card battles and befriend the wildlife to receive resources. Humblets is about wandering freely, finding hidden surprises and making memories along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/87a3f2ddd52adfb4e36e6d556e06abad.poster.avif?t=1754988347\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/87a3f2ddd52adfb4e36e6d556e06abad.webm?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694600/extras/87a3f2ddd52adfb4e36e6d556e06abad.mp4?t=1754988347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
